<section
    class="canva-section chapter"
    data-template-id="meetup-section"
    id="first-meetup"
    style="background:#242631"
>
    <div class="chapter-inner">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <p
                class="canva-text eyebrow mb-5"
                data-template-id="meetup-kicker"
                style="color: rgb(229, 183, 183); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
            >
                A moment to remember
            </p>
            <h2
                class="canva-text chapter-title"
                data-template-id="meetup-title"
                style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;"
            >
                The First Meetup
            </h2>
            <p
                class="canva-text body-copy mt-7"
                data-template-id="meetup-intro"
                style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 18px;"
            >
                Some moments deserve a page of their own. This one is waiting
                for the photograph and the words only you can give it.
            </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <div class="photo-frame rounded-2xl h-[340px] sm:h-[540px]">
                <img
                    alt="Warm scenic photograph placeholder for a personal first-meetup photo"
                    class="canva-image"
                    data-template-id="meetup-photo"
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2662116/pexels-photo-2662116.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1280"
                />
                <span
                    class="canva-tag photo-tag"
                    data-template-id="meetup-photo-label"
                    style="background: rgb(34, 43, 57); color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
                    >Your first-meetup photo goes here</span
                >
            </div>
            <figcaption
                class="canva-text serif text-center mt-7"
                data-template-id="meetup-caption"
                style="color: rgb(232, 197, 195); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 23px;"
            >
                One of the vivid memmories of us I still remember is the picnic of 2nd January, 2022. The first time we met IRL. it was such a fun day, we had so much fun, sitting in the upstairs room which Thakurprasad sir showed us and me, you, Adrika, Shruti were preparing the gift we gave to sir. Also the mustard fields and the cauliflower patches were so serene.
            </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="flex justify-center mt-12">
            <a
                aria-label="Continue to the second meeting"
                class="canva-link section-next"
                data-template-id="meetup-next"
                href="#second-meeting"
                style="color: rgb(255, 244, 223); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >Next chapter &darr;</a
            >
        </div>
    </div><span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute top-12 right-[8%] text-[#d6a9a8] text-4xl">✧</span
    >
</section>
